Subject: [PATCH 2939/3799] soh: rename func_80B40D50 -> EnXc_NextAfterAction72

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same guard from action 72 into the Nocturne reverse walk-off
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
index a4e06b837..f824ec41c 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Xc/z_en_xc.c
@@ -2032,7 +2032,8 @@ void EnXc_NextAfterAction71(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_71, SHEIK_ACTION_72);
 }
 
-void func_80B40D50(EnXc* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B40D50: the same guard from action 72 into the Nocturne reverse walk-off
+void EnXc_NextAfterAction72(EnXc* this) {
     EnXc_CheckAndSetAction(this, SHEIK_ACTION_72, SHEIK_ACTION_NOCTURNE_REVERSE_ACCEL);
 }
 
@@ -2212,7 +2213,7 @@ void EnXc_ActionFunc71(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnXc_ActionFunc72(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
     EnXc_ActionFunc13(this, play);
-    func_80B40D50(this);
+    EnXc_NextAfterAction72(this);  // was func_80B40D50 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void EnXc_ReverseAccelInNocturneCS(EnXc* this, PlayState* play) {
